{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suitcase Stories</i> is a <strong>short, cozy puzzle game</strong> about life\u2019s little moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suitcase you pack tells a story from childhood to adulthood, every object carries a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no timer, no score, no failure. Just the calm joy of arranging items until everything fits into place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack your suitcase</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag, drop, open and close compartments as you carefully fit every item inside. Each bag is a new chapter, reflecting a different stage of life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6ca9888270d739b547aa4369b58342b6.poster.avif?t=1773964045\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6ca9888270d739b547aa4369b58342b6.webm?t=1773964045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a kid\u2019s backpack to a work briefcase, from family trips to quiet retreats every suitcase represents a meaningful transition. The objects you arrange are small fragments of those memories. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6a365af9adceafd1bf16bb44589bf946.poster.avif?t=1773964045\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6a365af9adceafd1bf16bb44589bf946.webm?t=1773964045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush. Take your time, enjoy the relaxing soundtrack, and find satisfaction in the moment when everything clicks into place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Suitcase Stories offers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and cozy experience to enjoy in a single sitting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 suitcases, 7 chapters of life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 beautifully illustrated objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and soft sound effects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Suitcase Stories does not offer:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore puzzles or difficulty spikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer or online features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability beyond its short, crafted journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suitcase Stories</i> is meant to be a <strong>small but meaningful experience</strong>\u00a0a quiet pause to reflect, organize, and enjoy the simple act of seeing everything in its place.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974110/71c897fecb1dc112543148f7aa0001c9810d7fdf.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning of Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974110/7111712ba6434d3ed7870ec1b1e5dbbf3b80ed6e.jpg"},{"name":"Smell of Cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974110/f2009d5cf78917292a13fa3b0f5aefb1fb4b80f0.jpg"},{"name":"Finding Myself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974110/2c479709ea8d307b5a10a2ba30c3849f72ceafbf.jpg"},{"name":"Campus Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public